  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Approach to Transitional Justice to support accountability ICTJ</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Integrated Approach to Transitional Justice to support accountability ICTJ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ICTJs arbete som genom fredssamtalen i Colombia f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrat   fokus fr&#xe5;n generellt fr&#xe4;mjande av  r&#xe4;ttvisa och motverkande av        straffrihet mot en fokuserad inriktning p&#xe5; &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsr&#xe4;ttvisa f&#xf6;r att  uppn&#xe5; sanning, r&#xe4;ttvisa, reparation och s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;llande av att         &#xf6;vergreppen inte upprepas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden supports the ICTJ new approach which is shifting its focus     from the right to justice and the fight against impunity to an        integrated approach to Transitional Justice that will ensure          coherence between the distinct achieve truth, justice, reparations    and guarantees of non-recurrence measures in the currently colombia   peace negociations context.</narrative>
  </description>
